        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Cancer &mdash; 3rd (Cloth Ability) Technique, gained at level 11.</em></p><p><em>Soul Burial Waves &mdash; nearby spirits taken as gunpowder; the explosion is proportional to their strength.</em></p><p>Each creature in the area takes @Damage[6d8[void]] damage with a basic Fortitude save.</p><p>Add <strong>1d8 for every creature that has died in this area within the last hour</strong>, to a maximum of +5d8.</p><p>Undead and spirits in the area take an additional 2d8 damage and are slowed 1 on a failure.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
